{"title":"Glamourweaver","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 48 Fae that attacks with shock (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (7.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/fae-bowstring\">Fae Bowstring</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/glamourweaver\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glamourweaver?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glamourweaver?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>15</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glamourweaver?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>7</td><td>in the wilds around 1242, 1443</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glamourweaver?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>15</td><td>in the wilds around 2233, 1482</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 4 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 240 total, 39–145 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"fairy-dust\" title=\"Fairy Dust - in 75% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 7 total, 2–5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/31b71b633f13ad01ed72.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fairy Dust</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 3/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"fae-mote\" title=\"Fae Mote - in 100% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e330886da6237ae5ac02.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fae Mote</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 4/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gossamer-wing\" title=\"Gossamer Wing - in 75% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/20293d1b1defcc2a16d0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gossamer Wing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 3/4</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"gossamer-wing\" title=\"Gossamer Wing - in 75% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 7 total, 3–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/20293d1b1defcc2a16d0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gossamer Wing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 3/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"fae-mote\" title=\"Fae Mote - in 100% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 5 total, 2–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e330886da6237ae5ac02.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fae Mote</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 4/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"fairy-dust\" title=\"Fairy Dust - in 75% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 11 total, 11 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/31b71b633f13ad01ed72.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fairy Dust</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 3/4</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 8 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2218, 1480 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1254, 1402 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1233, 1447 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"glamourweaver\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Fae: <a href=\"#/monster/fairy\">Fairy</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/fae\">Fae</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight\">Gossamer Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(46)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/summer-queen\">Summer Queen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(52)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/ab8e44715f741cfa1e45.webp\" alt=\"Glamourweaver\"></div><h3>Glamourweaver</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>48 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 48–49)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Fae</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>shock · ranged</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>278</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>30.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2400</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>5</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>28 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}